’ ty taon-tariratse maro añe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mamorototo aolo’e eo ty afo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho mivoly ama’e ty soba miforehetse,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ie hoe golobo’ i Edene","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"ty aolo’e eo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le liolio, mangoakoake ty amboho’e;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"tsy eo ty mahaborifitse ama’e.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Manahake o soavalao iereo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho o mpiningi-tsoavalao,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"izay ty fitsondemboha’ iareo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Manahake ty fitrakotrakon-tsarete mitrantràñe an-dengom-bohitse ey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"hoe ty fikosisiha’ ty lel’afo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mipilotse ahetse,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho ondaty maozatse miriritse hialy.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mampalorè ondatio te zoeñe;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fonga mikò-foty o laharañeo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Manahake o fanalolahio ty filaisa’ iareo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"anganiha’ iareo o kijolio hoe lahin-defoñe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"songa mandrodo amy lala’ey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"tsy eo ty mivitsok’ am-pidadaña’e.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tsy mifampikititse iereo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fa songa mitrokotroko amy lala’ey;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"aa ndra te mipenkañe ty singa","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ipaoha’e, ie tsy fere.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Herereafe’ ty rova,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mirimatse an-drindriñe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"manganike mb’anjomba ao;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mitsoropoke an-dalan-kede hoe malaso.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Manginikinik’ aolo’e eo ty tane,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"miozoñozoñe o likerañeo;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mikò-mainte i àndroy naho i volañey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le asita’ o vasiañeo o fimilemile’eo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mampipoña-piarañanañañe añatrefa’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"o lahindefo’eo t’Iehovà;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy te ra’elahy o lahindefo’eo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fatratse o mañorike o tsara’eoo;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"toe jabajaba ty andro’ Iehovà","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho mampangebahebake,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ia ty mahafifeak’ ama’e?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ie amy zao, hoe t’Iehovà,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"itoliho an-kaliforan’arofo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho am-pililarañe, am-pirovetañe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho am-pangololoihañe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mandrovita arofo fa tsy sikiñe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le mitoliha am’ Iehovà","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Andrianañahare’ areo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fa matarike naho miferenaiñe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"malaon-kaviñerañe naho ra’elahy","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"an-kafatraram-pikokoañe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho teñene’e ty fametsahan-kankàñe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ia ty mahafohiñe, hera hibalike re","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho hiheve, vaho hamopoke fañanintsiñe am-boho’e eo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"añengao mahakama naho enga-rano","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"am’Iehovà Andrianañahare’ areo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Popoho e Tsione ao i antsivay,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"añamasiño lilitse, koiho ty fivory miavake;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Atontono ondatio; hamasiño ty fivory,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"arokandrokaño o androanavio,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"atolaho o ajajao","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"rekets’ o milomolomo am-patroao,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ampiakaro an-kivoho’e i mpañengay,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"boak’ an-kiboho’e ao i enga-vaoy.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ehe te hiharovetse añivo’ i fizilihañey","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho i kitreliy o mpisoroñe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mpitoro’ Iehovào, hanao ty hoe:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ferenaiño ondati’oo, ry Iehovà,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le ko atolo’o ho arinjeñeñe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"o lova’oo hamokafoka’ o kilakila’ ndatio;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"aa vaho akore t’ie hampiboele","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"am’ondatio ty hoe:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Aia t’i Andrianañahare’ iareo?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nikirañe i tane’ey amy zao","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"t’Iehovà, vaho ferenaiña’e ondati’eo,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Hanoiñe t’Iehovà","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"hanao ty hoe am’ondati’eo:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ingo te hampañitrifeko ampemba vao","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho divay vao vaho menake,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"haha-anjañe anahareo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le tsy hanoeko ho fañinjea’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"o kilakila’ ondatio ka.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Fa hasitako lavitse anahareo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"o ‘ntavaratseo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho haronjeko mb’an-tane","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"harake naho bangìñe añe;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"hitolike mb’amy riak’ atiñanañey o mpiaolo’eo, naho o am-boli’eo mb’an-driak’ ahandrefañey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le hionjoñe ty imbo’e","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho hiambone ty fitrotrora’e,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy te ra’elahy o nanoe’eo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ko hemban-drehe ry tane;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mifalea naho mandià taroba;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy te fanjàka o fitoloña’ Iehovào.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ko matahotse ry bibin-kivokeo;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fa mbe haindoñindoñe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"o fiandrazañe am-patrambeio,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mbe hamoa ty voa’e o hatae’eo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"songa hamokatse","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ty sakoa naho ty vahe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Mirebeha ry ana’ i Tsioneo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mifalea am’ ­Iehovà Andrianañahare’ areo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fa havantañañe ty mampahavy","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"i ora-mafaitsey,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"toe hampahavia’e orañe,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"i aoloy naho i orañ’asotriy","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"manahake te taolo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ho lifotse ampemba o rihao,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho handopatse divay","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho menake o sajoao.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Havahako ama’ areo o taoñe nabotse’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"o valalao, naho o maramboloo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"naho o beañeo vaho o voan-taneo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"i mpirai-lian-dahin-defoñe","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"niraheko ama’ areoy.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ho eneñe mahakama nahareo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"toe ho anjañe, naho ho rengè’ areo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ty tahina’ Iehovà","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Andrianañahare’ areo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"amy hasoa tsitantane nitoloña’ey;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho tsy ho salatse ka ondatikoo.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Le ho fohi’ areo te añivo’ Israele","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ao iraho","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":",","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le te Izaho, Iehovà Andrianañahare’ areo","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ro tsy aman-tovo’e,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"vaho tsy ho salatse ka ondatikoo.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"Edene: Hafalea; Finembanembañe","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":3}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"Ies 24:23","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":27}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/tdx_sle/JOL/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/JOL/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/tdx_sle/JOL/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}